{"id":"wx2652831764","title":"开放报名！华农首批微专业招生啦！","published_at":"2025-03-13T19:12:48+08:00","published_label":"2025-03-13","cover":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcibYJCMCWuH2C1D37v6tRKjWzdbA05NicH3uib3oRm5t0SGmsyiaAsxYCPOib58asEkiaL3ZnMXR0aTN3WQ/0?wx_fmt=jpeg","summary":"想探索更多知识领域 实现跨专业联动学习? 马上安排！ 为 助力广大华农学子 实现 个性化、多样化发展 学校首批微专业正式招生啦！ 什么是微专业？ 有哪些微专业可供选择？怎么报名？ 下拉了解详情！ 01 微专业是什么？…","tags":["通知","人物"],"source":"wechat","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&mid=2652831764&idx=1&sn=1e4cb21c14dde2fc99cce0460be1ed3a","paper_url":null,"word_count":1941,"fetched_at":"2026-11-09T16:42:54+08:00","content_html":"<div><section><section><p><span><img alt=\"图片\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc9lj00AbDo9CASMrIianLISntnWZicodQfAhlG8jKVKdJuCevK2lfsS6Lh75aHwzkKd39UmddlRlZDw/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\"/><br/></span></p><p><span>想探索更多知识领域</span></p><section><span>实现跨专业联动学习?</span></section><section><span>马上安排！<br/></span></section><section><span><span>为</span>助力广大华农学子<span>实现</span></span></section><section><span>个性化、多样化发展</span></section><section><span><strong>学校首批微专业正式招生啦！</strong></span></section><section><span>什么是微专业？</span></section><section><span>有哪些微专业可供选择？怎么报名？</span></section><section><span>下拉了解详情！</span></section></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcicC0nBWvJFefcUF90psVtF1zKibFH8NtIuqbnZpBCu3qqS3dvNy9BogON1DfWvsAklDZT0oG7uyhGQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>01</strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>微专业是什么？</strong></span><strong> </strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p>微专业是指为满足学生个性化和多样化发展需求，<span>在现有本科专业目录以外，立足经济社会发展对人才的需求，围绕某一特定领域、研究方向或者核心素养开设的一组核心课程，</span>通过灵活且系统的培养，使学生具备跨学科交叉融合能力，能够在特定领域具备特定的专业素养和从业能力。</p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>02</strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>微专业有哪些优势？ </strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section>微专业具有“<span>少、精、尖、跨</span>”的特点。</section><p><span>■ “少”</span>是指课程少，一般由<span>5-6门</span>课程组成，总学分<span>10-12</span>学分，培养周期为<span>3-4个</span>学期。</p><p><span>■ “精”</span>是指围绕微专业培养目标精准设计课程，课程体系兼具科学性、前沿性、适应性和技术技能应用性。</p><p><span>■ “尖”</span>是指聚焦科技前沿、战略新兴产业。</p><p><span>■ “跨”</span>是指跨专业、跨学科，促进学科交叉融合。</p><p><span>微专业着重解决大学专业设置与新形势新发展下产业用人需求之间的匹配问题。</span>在教学方式上，注重产教结合，聘请企业家或经验丰富的创业人员现场教学，让学生获得更多实践机会，增强大学生就业能力和创新创业能力。</p></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9GE6Rga6yxevia18JJRAkXPmGqBNAkXic18R1hEJZYCMLsao4MI3US9gEX3FFPEPzibo9L9hE1NdEBw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>03</strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><strong>首批微专业有哪些？</strong></span><strong> </strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>学校首批开设了五个微专业，各专业招生简章如下：</span></p><p><strong><span>智慧养殖技术与管理</span></strong></p><section>h<span>ttps://dongke.scau.edu.cn/2025/0313/c711a402179/page.htm</span></section><p><strong><span>生物信息学方法与应用</span></strong></p><section><span>https://life.scau.edu.cn/2025/0313/c10476a402196/page.htm</span></section><p><strong><span>大数据分析与治理</span></strong></p><section>https://info.scau.edu.cn/2025/0313/c3772a402203/page.htm</section><p><strong><span>+人工智能</span></strong></p><section><span>https://dzxy.scau.edu.cn/2025/0313/c9653a402190/page.htm</span></section><section><strong><span>基层治理与公务能力</span></strong></section><section><span>https://ggglxy.scau.edu.cn/2025/0313/c12018a402207/page.htm</span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>04</strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>如何修读？</strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p>1. <span>我校学生在大一或大二的春季学期提出修读申请，每个学生限报1个微专业。</span></p><section>2. 微专业单独编班授课，原则上30人以上方可开班。</section><section>3. 微专业教学安排在<span>教学周学生空闲时段，或集中安排在周末、假期授课</span>。</section><p><span>4.微专业课程成绩评定按《华南农业大学本科课程考核管理规定》执行。学生微专业课程考核成绩纳入学校教务管理平台；微专业课程不能申请免修或免听；微专业成绩单单列，不纳入学生综合测评。</span></p><section>5. 学生如在校期间未完成微专业规定学分，学校只提供修读成绩单，取得学分的微专业课程可认定为主修专业课程（须名称相同、学分和课程性质一致），或认定为通识选修课程。</section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8mLGzCicYQujnOkicicxNjJxhx2C5tHIfOBIaHYlUI0MGz8v2wpHnpC07FH8u00l5UTIMIibgoAxQsXQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>05</strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>是否发证书？</strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section>学生主修专业学业结束，无论毕业或者结业离校，微专业学习同时终止。学生在校期间完成微专业全部课程，获得规定学分，经学院审核，报本科生院审定，<span>发放学校统一制作的微专业结业证书。</span>微专业不在中国高等教育学生信息网（学信网）备注信息，不具有学士学位授予资格。</section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>06</strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>是否收费？ </strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><strong>学生修读微专业不收费。</strong></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>首批微专业如何报名</strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcibYJCMCWuH2C1D37v6tRKjWmfRknxqvoUsktemmvr907UnUJEDMslj50bLenunzCNFiabYqmjy862Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span>■ </span>申请修读微专业2023级、2024级学生，在符合《华南农业大学微专业建设管理办法（试行）》（华南农办〔2024〕36号）和《华南农业大学2025年微专业招生计划表》中招收要求的情况下，在<span>教务系统（http://jwxt.scau.edu.cn/）</span>辅修管理中报名。</section><section><span>■</span><span><span> 申请报名的学生于</span><span>3月16日8:00-18日12:00登录教务系统，在“辅修管理”菜单下选择“辅修报名”，在2025年微专业批次中，选择拟报读微专业进行报名，报名时需填写申请理由，报读类别选择辅修</span><span>（注：教务系统内报读类别下提示内容不适用于本次微专业报名）。</span><span>未在教务系统中报名或不在规定时间内报名无效。</span></span></section><section><span>■ </span><span>可点击“阅读原文”查看报名通知和下载相关附件</span><span>，</span><span>并关注相关学院网站了解各微专业招录详情。</span></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc9GE6Rga6yxevia18JJRAkXPavcWbWERporYYfX71Ld40gv5skkdxiaoXRb7eicHGv8n2oicibPSvhunvQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><span>触类旁通，方能智慧丛生</span></section><section><span>跨域求索，或许觅得志趣</span></section><section><span>学科交叉，助力职业发展</span></section><section><span>快来pick你中意的专业</span></section><section><span>成为妥妥的跨界人才！</span></section></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc8fqBCmibkvpEdyIpniakVDIibbIEc1euA007C8su9TiaTZicvAPXoNyfYe7fkNyA3BwOjl5y9yzeup8pA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>往期回顾</strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652831729&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=b89fb561384dad4